/-- An induction principle for span membership. If `p` holds for 0 and all elements of `s`, and is
preserved under addition and scalar multiplication, then `p` holds for all elements of the span of
`s`. -/
@[elab_as_elim]
/-
**Submodule.span_induction** 是 Mathlib 中的一个定理，位于命名空间 `Submodule`。
形式化陈述：span_induction {p : (x : M) -> x in span R s -> Prop} (mem : forall (x) (h
 : x in s), p x (subset_span h)) (zero : p 0 (Submodule.zero_mem _)) (add : fora
ll x y hx hy, p x hx -> p y hy -> p (x + y) (Submodule.add_mem _ ‹_› ‹_›)) (smul
 : forall (a : R) (x hx), p x hx -> p (a • x) (Submodule.smul_mem _ _ ‹_›)) {x} 
(hx : x in span R s) : p x hx
参数：x : M；mem : forall (x) (h : x in s), p x (subset_span h)；zero : p 0 (Submodul
e.zero_mem _)；add : forall x y hx hy, p x hx -> p y hy -> p (x + y) (Submodule.a
dd_mem _ ‹_› ‹_›)；smul : forall (a : R) (x hx), p x hx -> p (a • x) (Submodule.s
